body_text:
### The problem

My Tuya Zigbee Dual Meter (category pc, product_id dhotiauw) exposes many data points in the Tuya App (Forward energy total, Reverse energy total, Voltage, Supply frequency, Power total , power factor, Current, Power, etc.), for both a "Channel A" and "Channel B"

But Home Assistant only shows power (cur_power) and voltage (cur_voltage) for only "Channel A".

### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?

core-2026.4.1

### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?

_No response_

### What type of installation are you running?

Home Assistant OS

### Integration causing the issue

Tuya

### Link to integration documentation on our website

https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/tuya

